            "review_text": "Letyze\nLincoln, United Kingdom164 contributions\n0\nSimply fantastic\nDec 2024 • Friends\nAbsolutely my favorite place. Lovely surroundings, great staff, fantastic food! Don’t miss out if you’re nearby. \n\nJust had Christmas dinner here. Great price for a fantastic meal with excellent service\nWritten December 25, 2024\nOwner's R\nThanks a lot for your kind comments and support. Have a lovely day!\nKind regards, \nThe team of Tartine Saigon\n-—————— \nTartine Saïgon, artisan bakery-café-restaurants run by passionate sourdough bakers\n🍸🍻🍷Happy Hour every day 3-7pm\nWe are open 🕑 7am-10pm at all our locations: \n📍 Tartine Saïgon - 25 Nguyen Dinh Chieu, Q1 ❄️🍕\n📍 Tartine Saïgon - 215 Lý Tự Trọng, Q1 ❄️\n📍 Tartine Saïgon Thao Dien, Q2 ❄️🍕\n📍 Tartine Saïgon An Phu, Q2 \n📍 Tartine Saïgon Vista Verde, Q2 ❄️🍕\n📍 Tartine Saïgon - Bà Huyện Thanh Quan, Q3 ❄️🍕\n📍 Tartine Saïgon PMH Mỹ Khang, Phu My Hung, Q7 ❄️🍕\nRead more\nWritten August 17, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
